<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Yuri Gagarin becomes the first person in space</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-rwanda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Rwanda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Rwanda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A UN-supervised referendum confirms the abolition of the monarchy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/union-of-south-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Union%20of%20South%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Union of South Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Union becomes the Republic of South Africa on 31 May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-south-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20South%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of South Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Union becomes the Republic of South Africa and leaves the Commonwealth</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-burundi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Burundi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Burundi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">UPRONA wins the elections; its leader, Prince Louis Rwagasore, is assassinated</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/syrian-arab-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Syrian%20Arab%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Syrian Arab Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 28 September a coup takes Syria out of the United Arab Republic and ends the political union with Egypt.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-morocco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Morocco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Morocco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hassan II becomes King on 3 March; he holds the first general elections in 1963, then declares a state of emergency and suspends parliament in 1965.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/non-aligned-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Non-Aligned%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Non-Aligned Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first Conference of Heads of State or Government of Non-Aligned Countries meets in Belgrade</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/legalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Legalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Legalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Herrlee G. Creel’s Legalists or Administrators? leads many scholars to avoid the term Legalism</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pan-arabism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pan-Arabism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pan-Arabism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Syrian army officers carry out a coup and take Syria out of the United Arab Republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/nelson-mandela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nelson%20Mandela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nelson Mandela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Acquitted in the Treason Trial, he co-founds Umkhonto we Sizwe, which announces itself with 57 bombings in December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/portuguese-angola"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Portuguese%20Angola.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Portuguese Angola</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Holden Roberto's incursion of 15 March opens the war for independence; the same year the Estatuto do Indigenato is abolished</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/berlin"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Berlin.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Berlin</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">East Germany begins to build the Berlin Wall</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/cyrus-cylinder"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Cyrus%20Cylinder.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Cyrus Cylinder</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Fragment A was restored, re-fired and given plaster fillings</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/suleymaniye-mosque"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/S%C3%BCleymaniye%20Mosque.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Süleymaniye Mosque</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A restoration of the prayer hall began, removing 19th-century wall decoration and reviving earlier designs beneath it</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/patrice-lumumba"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Patrice%20Lumumba.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Patrice Lumumba</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Flown to Katanga on 17 January and shot that night; his body is later dug up and dissolved in acid</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/jehovahs-witnesses"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jehovah's%20Witnesses.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Jehovah's Witnesses</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The full New World Translation of the Holy Scriptures is released</span></li></ul></section>
